## Counterbalanced performance

Pending the required follow-up evidence commit. Immutable A/B artifacts
will be built and set mode 0555 only after this complete production tree is
committed. The single accepted protocol is: idle-machine check, two
discarded warmups per artifact, six counterbalanced pairs
AB/BA/AB/BA/AB/BA, retain every sample, and decide on aggregate medians,
median paired B/A ratio at most 1.05, and maximum-RSS increase at most
16 MiB. No discretionary rerun is permitted.
